Fix PKCS#11 module double-initialization in apple-codesign.

A PKCS#11 module can only be initialized once per process. rcodesign on
upstream main initializes the module both while resolving the certificate
source and again for each signing operation; the second C_Initialize fails
with CKR_CRYPTOKI_ALREADY_INITIALIZED, which breaks signing with the Google
Cloud KMS PKCS#11 library (and any other PKCS#11 module).

This is the apple-codesign/src portion of the upstream fix:
https://github.com/indygreg/apple-platform-rs/pull/350
(head commit 399e5a8e57ba6c35d1c221be7424f6ba3cfddd6b)

Drop this patch once the pull request lands and the pinned revision in
action.yml is bumped past it.

